{"id":"1214dfa97a3efe0f","group":"58","path":"58/batch02/58-df-zfc-model5-language-signature.md","title":"ZFC Model5 Language Signature","display":"df-zfc-model5-language-signature — ZFC Model5 Language Signature","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-model5-language-signature","aliases":["58-df-zfc-model5-language-signature"],"display":"df-zfc-model5-language-signature — ZFC Model5 Language Signature","depends_on":["[[58-ax-zfc]]","[[../batch06/58-df-first-order-language.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-model5-language-signature"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-model5-language-signature</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-model5-language-signature — ZFC Model5 Language Signature"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"58-ax-zfc\">58-ax-zfc</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"3888033a846b1cd5\" href=\"?note=3888033a846b1cd5\" title=\"../batch06/58-df-first-order-language.md\">../batch06/58-df-first-order-language.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L\\in V\">\\(L\\in V\\)</span> (language-signature code)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcModel5LanguageSignature}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcModel5LanguageSignature}_S\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{FirstOrderLanguage}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{FirstOrderLanguage}_S\\)</span> (canonical language predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"3888033a846b1cd5\" href=\"?note=3888033a846b1cd5\" title=\"../batch06/58-df-first-order-language.md\">../batch06/58-df-first-order-language.md</a>)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}model5\\text{-}language\\text{-}signature} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcModel5LanguageSignature}_S(L)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{FirstOrderLanguage}_S(L)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}model5\\text{-}language\\text{-}signature} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcModel5LanguageSignature}_S(L)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{FirstOrderLanguage}_S(L)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>This compatibility predicate is exactly the canonical four-component first-order-language code <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\langle R,F,C,\\operatorname{ar}\\rangle\">\\(\\langle R,F,C,\\operatorname{ar}\\rangle\\)</span> used by the formula and structure atoms. It does not introduce a competing five-component signature.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-ax-zfc","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-ax-zfc]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch06/58-df-first-order-language.md","status":"resolved","id":"3888033a846b1cd5","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch06/58-df-first-order-language.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch06/58-df-first-order-language.md","status":"resolved","id":"3888033a846b1cd5","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{FirstOrderLanguage}_S$ (canonical language predicate, see [[../batch06/58-df-first-order-language.md]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"L\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcModel5LanguageSignature}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{FirstOrderLanguage}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}model5\\text{-}language\\text{-}signature} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcModel5LanguageSignature}_S(L)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{FirstOrderLanguage}_S(L)","display":true},{"tex":"\\langle R,F,C,\\operatorname{ar}\\rangle","display":false}],"bytes":1059,"backlinks":[{"id":"5422fa2d4aa74b03","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":3,"excerpt":"$L=\\langle C,F,a_F,R,a_R\\rangle$ (five-component language signature, see [[../batch02/58-df-zfc-model5-language-signature]])"},{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-2754","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch02/58-df-zfc-model5-language-signature.md|58-df-zfc-model5-language-signature]]（batch02）"}],"outgoing":["a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","3888033a846b1cd5"]}